obs The hot pass reads 255 guards and one red, standing_equipment, whose scan reports the run card's recorded dated_path red. That is downstream rather than a second fault: no lap may lower dated_path's field count, so the roster guard reds on every ship until the gate question is answered -- which is itself the shape a gate somebody turns off.
scope one lap -- two standing reds read, one closed, one repaired twice and left honestly red at its field gate
status GREEN on every instrument I touched: shim_reason, gitlink_dependent, session_roster_agree, ascii_resident_agree, rish_report_bound, living_pin_near_bound, pin_bound_touch. dated_path refuses at its field ceiling, which is the standing question on the card and not mine to move; every one of its control legs is GREEN and now runs.
